{"uid":"56fe2c690d25f445","name":"QA 2111","fullName":"QA #2111 on ubuntu2604-container","historyId":"2111@ubuntu2604-container","time":{"start":1794450832000,"stop":1794450836000,"duration":4000},"description":"PCP QA Test No. 2111\n\nExercise pmlogpush HTTP Basic authentication over a secure (TLS) connection.\n\n\n\nThe push model authenticates its clients against pmcd, reusing PCP's SASL\n\nmachinery: pmproxy holds no password store of its own, it validates the\n\nsupplied credentials by opening a short-lived authenticated pmcd context.\n\nThis test provisions a real pmcd SASL user (as qa/1388 does) and verifies:\n\n- pmlogpush --secure -U/-P with valid credentials succeeds against a\n\npmproxy that requires authentication ([pmlogger] authenticate = true)\n\n- the password may be read from --password-file or $PCP_PUSH_PASSWORD\n\n- a valid user with the wrong password is rejected and no archive is written\n\n- --secure with no credentials is rejected and no archive is written\n\n- -U without --secure is refused client-side: credentials are never sent\n\nover a cleartext or unauthenticated connection\n\n\n\ncheck-group-include: pmlogpush\n\n\n\nCopyright (c) 2025 Red Hat.  All Rights Reserved.\n\n\n\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>PCP QA Test No. 2111</p>\n<p>Exercise pmlogpush HTTP Basic authentication over a secure (TLS) connection.</p>\n<p>The push model authenticates its clients against pmcd, reusing PCP's SASL</p>\n<p>machinery: pmproxy holds no password store of its own, it validates the</p>\n<p>supplied credentials by opening a short-lived authenticated pmcd context.</p>\n<p>This test provisions a real pmcd SASL user (as qa/1388 does) and verifies:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>pmlogpush --secure -U/-P with valid credentials succeeds against a</li>\n</ul>\n<p>pmproxy that requires authentication ([pmlogger] authenticate = true)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>the password may be read from --password-file or $PCP_PUSH_PASSWORD</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>a valid user with the wrong password is rejected and no archive is written</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>--secure with no credentials is rejected and no archive is written</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>-U without --secure is refused client-side: credentials are never sent</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>over a cleartext or unauthenticated connection</p>\n<p>check-group-include: pmlogpush</p>\n<p>Copyright (c) 2025 Red Hat.  All Rights Reserved.</p>\n","status":"passed","statusMessage":"","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"afterStages":[],"labels":[{"name":"suite","value":"ubuntu2604-container"},{"name":"host","value":"ubuntu2604-container"},{"name":"epic","value":"pmproxy"},{"name":"epic","value":"pmlogpush"},{"name":"epic","value":"libpcp_web"},{"name":"epic","value":"secure"},{"name":"epic","value":"pmcd"},{"name":"epic","value":"local"},{"name":"resultFormat","value":"allure2"}],"parameters":[],"links":[{"name":"Source","url":"https://github.com/performancecopilot/pcp/tree/fdd30b634c13570bb9679b34b871a59291380998/qa/2111","type":"test_case"},{"name":"Expected output","url":"https://github.com/performancecopilot/pcp/tree/fdd30b634c13570bb9679b34b871a59291380998/qa/2111.out","type":"test_case"}],"hidden":false,"retry":false,"extra":{"severity":"normal","retries":[],"categories":[],"history":{"statistic":{"failed":0,"broken":0,"skipped":0,"passed":41,"unknown":0,"total":41},"items":[{"uid":"3d94da2f8704fc05","reportUrl":"https://performancecopilot.github.io/qa-reports/reports/20261111_021346-596d3d90//#testresult/3d94da2f8704fc05","status":"passed","statusDetails":"","time":{"start":1794361701000,"stop":1794361708000,"duration":7000}},{"uid":"d98f298f4dd799dc","reportUrl":"https://performancecopilot.github.io/qa-reports/reports/20261110_050126-596d3d90//#testresult/d98f298f4dd799dc","status":"passed","statusDetails":"","time":{"start":1794283796000,"stop":1794283804000,"duration":8000}},{"uid":"e65d8c91c2c52978","reportUrl":"https://performa